WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.351
Move your WordPress content. Not your mess.

2
00:00:04.351 --> 00:00:21.084
Pick exactly what moves: the homepage, and the settings that go with it.

3
00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:31.710
One file with the content, its images and its settings.

4
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:42.589
On another site, the WordPress Importer you already know takes it.

5
00:00:42.589 --> 00:00:49.922
The homepage is still the homepage — images included. No search-and-replace.

6
00:00:49.922 --> 00:01:27.207
Or send it as a plugin: installed on the other site, it brings what it needs and imports itself.

7
00:01:27.207 --> 00:01:47.379
Or the whole site as a WordPress Playground .zip — a copy made on localhost opens on playground.wordpress.net.

8
00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:55.420
Or run it offline with one command.

9
00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:00.180
Free and open source — eizport.github.io
